# Cleansing's count is the fewest of Bot1's lands it would destroy with no life paid, whatever choices are made as they
# are destroyed (CR 616.1; the owner's decision of 2026-11-28): Pyramids has shielded Bot1's Island, and Bot2's Rest in
# Peace offers another replacement for its destruction. Applied first, Rest in Peace leaves Pyramids nothing to replace
# and the Island goes; Pyramids applied first saves it. So with no life paid Bot1 could lose as few as its two Plains,
# no more than the 2 life the players have, and Cleansing is not countered (rulings). Then no one pays, Bot1 applies
# Pyramids first, and the Island stays.

[Life]
Bot1: 1
Bot2: 1

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Pyramids
Equinox
Island
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Rest in Peace
Black Lotus
Cleansing
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyramids.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Ability: Add)
Bot1.Hand.Equinox.Cast(Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Rest in Peace.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Hand.Cleansing.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Pyramids.Activate
Bot1.Modes(The next time target land)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate(Stack.Cleansing; Ability: Counter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Choose()
Bot1.Choose()
Bot1.Replace(Pyramids)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains = (absent)
Bot1.Life = 1
Bot2.Life = 1
